   "h": "1ea25a96d5d356b7",
   "s": "The TR-XL Stack Separator is the largest available from O.M.B, designed for slicing the largest of rockets in twain. Unlike Decouplers, Separators will eject anything connected to themselves. This is good, as it removes the need to worry about which side needs to be pointed away from face. Try to not look at it too much though.",
